<title>USA: AM-PAC acquires LeisureShare.</title>
<headline>AM-PAC acquires LeisureShare.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>AM-PAC International Inc. said on Wednesday it acquired LeisureShare International Plc in a stock and cash transaction.</p>
<p>LeisureShare, formed in 1983 with a capital base of US$3.7 million, is a British development corporation with an independent appraised asset value of over $14 million.</p>
<p>AM-PAC International is a holding company focused on the acquisition and development of international food, beverage and leisure opportunities.</p>
</text>
